  "notes": [
    "-AR verb with a spelling change: **z→c before e** to preserve the /s/ (Latin America) or /θ/ (Spain) sound. This affects the yo form of the pretérito indefinido (esbocé, not *esbozé) and every form of the subjuntivo presente and the usted/nosotros/ustedes imperative forms (esboce, esbocemos, esbocen).",
    "No stem change — purely an orthographic adjustment.",
    "Past participle is regular: **esbozado**.",
    "*El artista esbozó el retrato en pocos minutos.* (\"The artist sketched the portrait in a few minutes.\")",
    "*La película esboza los orígenes de un corazón revolucionario.* (\"The film outlines the origins of a revolutionary heart.\")",
    "Related: *el esbozo* (sketch/outline, noun), *dibujar* (broader, \"to draw\"), other -zar verbs share this pattern (rechazar, abrazar, avanzar, cruzar)."
  ],
